### Obtain a JWT token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### List users via the gateway
GET http://localhost:8083/gateway/users

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:8081/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "charlie",
  "password": "charlie123",
  "email": "charlie@example.com",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Create a device via the device service
POST http://localhost:8082/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inverter",
  "type": "INVERTER",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "maxConsumption": 3.7
}

### Fetch all devices through the gateway
GET http://localhost:8083/gateway/devices
